Subject: [geomorph-r-package] modularity.test - one landmarks important for multiple modules

Hello,

I am running a modularity analysis using the modularity.test function for different regions of the endocast. I have designated my 36 landmarks to six modules by hand (i.e. land.gps <-c("A","A","B","B", "C"...)). However, I have nine landmarks which represent the borders of multiple structures and therefore assigning them to one module is difficult. Is there a way to include a single landmark in multiple modules or do I need to make some decisions about what landmarks to assign to a single module?

Best,

Madlen

